  "notes": "USAGE: {開通|かいつう} is specifically used for infrastructure like roads, railways, tunnels, and communication lines.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・{開通|かいつう}する (to open for service)\n・{開通|かいつう}{式|しき} (opening ceremony)\n・{開通|かいつう}{記念|きねん} (opening commemoration)\n・{全線|ぜんせん}{開通|かいつう} (full line opening)\n・{部分|ぶぶん}{開通|かいつう} (partial opening)\n\nAPPLIES TO:\n・{道路|どうろ} - roads\n・{鉄道|てつどう} - railways\n・トンネル - tunnels\n・{橋|はし} - bridges\n・{電話|でんわ}{回線|かいせん} - phone lines\n\nCONTRAST:\n・{開業|かいぎょう} - opening (of a business)\n・{開店|かいてん} - store opening",
